{"id":10057,"name":"absol-mega","speciesId":359,"dex":359,"form":"mega","generation":3,"types":["dark"],"stats":{"hp":65,"attack":150,"defense":60,"special-attack":115,"special-defense":60,"speed":115},"abilities":[{"name":"magic-bounce","hidden":false}],"height":12,"weight":490,"baseExp":198,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10057.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/10057.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10057.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/10057.ogg","genus":"Disaster Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"ruby","text":"Every time ABSOL appears before people, it is followed by a disaster such as an earthquake or a tidal wave. As a result, it came to be known as the disaster POKéMON."},{"version":"sapphire","text":"ABSOL has the ability to foretell the coming of natural disasters. It lives in a harsh, rugged mountain environment. This POKéMON very rarely ventures down from the mountains."},{"version":"emerald","text":"It sharply senses even subtle changes in the sky and the land to predict natural disasters. It is a long-lived POKéMON that has a life-span of 100 years."},{"version":"firered","text":"It appears when it senses an impending natural disaster. As a result, it was mistaken as a doom-bringer."},{"version":"diamond","text":"It senses coming disasters and appears before people only to warn them of impending danger."},{"version":"platinum","text":"Rumored to sense disasters with its horn, it became a target. It fled deep into the mountains."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"It has the ability to foretell natural disasters. Its life span is over a hundred years."},{"version":"black-2","text":"It appears from deep in the mountains to warn people about upcoming disasters it has sensed with its horn."},{"version":"y","text":"It appears when it senses an impending natural disaster. As a result, it was mistaken as a doom bringer."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Every time Absol appears before people, it is followed by a disaster such as an earthquake or a tidal wave. As a result, it came to be known as the disaster Pokémon."},{"version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Absol has the ability to foretell the coming of natural disasters. It lives in a harsh, rugged mountain environment. This Pokémon very rarely ventures down from the mountains."},{"version":"sun","text":"Long ago, superstitions were spread about it, saying it brought disaster. This fed a hatred of it, and it was driven deep into the mountains."},{"version":"moon","text":"Although it’s said to bring disaster, in actuality, this Pokémon possesses a calm disposition and warns people of any crises that loom."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"The only thing unlucky about Absol is its appearance. It protects fields and warns people of disaster, so one ought to be grateful for it."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"The elderly call it the disaster Pokémon and detest it, but interest in its power to predict disasters is on the rise."},{"version":"sword","text":"Swift as the wind, Absol races through fields and mountains. Its curved, bow-like horn is acutely sensitive to the warning signs of natural disasters."},{"version":"shield","text":"Because of this Pokémon’s ability to detect danger, people mistook Absol as a bringer of doom."}],"genderRate":4,"captureRate":30,"eggGroups":["ground"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"absol","speciesId":359,"evolvesTo":[]},"varieties":[{"id":359,"name":"absol","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/359.png"},{"id":10057,"name":"absol-mega","form":"mega","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10057.png"},{"